# Build context is the repo root (server/Dockerfile and gateway/Dockerfile
# use context `.` so they can COPY the built frontend, the ext2 and the
# shared shell lib). Whitelist only what the images COPY, so the context
# stays small (the ~500 MB webvm/ tree is unavoidable: the server image
# needs webvm/build + webvm/custom-disk-images).
*
!server/**
!gateway/**
!scripts/lib/**
!webvm/build/**
!webvm/custom-disk-images/**
